{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../ChatEventFilter/", "title": "ChatEventFilter"}, "next": {"link": "../ChatJoiner/", "title": "ChatJoiner"}, "title": "ChatInviteLink", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"chatinvitelink\">\n<h1>ChatInviteLink<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#chatinvitelink\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.ChatInviteLink\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatInviteLink</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ChatInviteLink\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>An invite link for a chat.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>invite_link</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 The invite link. If the link was created by another chat administrator, then the second part of the\nlink will be replaced with \u201c\u2026\u201d.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>date</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">datetime</span></code></a>) \u2013 The date when the link was created.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>is_primary</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>) \u2013 True, if the link is primary.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>is_revoked</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>) \u2013 True, if the link is revoked.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>creator</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Creator of the link.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Invite link name</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>creates_join_request</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 True, if users joining the chat via the link need to be approved by chat administrators.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>start_date</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">datetime</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Point in time when the link has been edited.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>expire_date</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">datetime</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Point in time when the link will expire or has been expired.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>member_limit</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Maximum number of users that can be members of the chat simultaneously after joining the chat via this\ninvite link; 1-99999.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>member_count</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Number of users that joined via this link and are currently member of the chat.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>pending_join_request_count</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Number of pending join requests created using this link.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>expired_member_count</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Number of chat members, which joined the chat using the link, but have already left because of expired subscription; for subscription links only.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>subscription_period</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 The number of seconds the subscription will be active for before the next payment.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>subscription_price</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 The amount of Telegram Stars a user must pay initially and after each subsequent subscription period to be a member of the chat using the link.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/ChatJoiner", "ChatJoiner", "N", "next"], ["api/types/ChatEventFilter", "ChatEventFilter", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">ChatInviteLink</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ChatInviteLink\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatInviteLink</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/types/ChatInviteLink", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}